# --- JWT keys ---
# Private signing keys are never committed. Only the labelled test-only pair
# (src/test/resources/test-*.pem, see TEST-ONLY-KEYS.md) is allowed. Product
# security rule authorised by Phase 2 CONTEXT; local tooling stays in .git/info/exclude.
*.pem
app/keys/dev/
!app/services/users/src/test/resources/test-*.pem
